# The one password `$82:B018` tests by its letters and not by its tables.
#
# It stores level 0 and leaves the count of neighbours alone. The card that
# comes up for level 0 reads DAY OF THE TENTACLE, and the level under it is
# one no other movie here reaches: frame 2400 is the card and frame 2990 is
# the level.
#
# For `password_check`'s first exit, `password_cheat`, which no movie took.
#
# Regenerate with:
#
#     python tools/make_password_movie.py BCDF > movies/password-bcdf.zmv
#
# and put this comment back.
